ose.</a></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">The faceless facilitators.</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/5/52/The_faceless_facilitators..png/revision/latest?cb=20240912213159\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"The faceless facilitators.\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/5/52/The_faceless_facilitators..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20240912213159\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/5/52/The_faceless_facilitators..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20240912213159 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/5/52/The_faceless_facilitators..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20240912213159 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"The faceless facilitators.\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"The_faceless_facilitators..png\" data-image-name=\"The faceless facilitators..png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_18\" title=\"Series 18\">18</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rosie_Jones\" title=\"Rosie Jones\">Rosie Jones</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ambience_and_information.\" title=\"Ambience and information.\">Ambience and information.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/...and_then_a_detective_comes_in.\" title=\"...and then a detective comes in.\">...and then a detective comes in.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>The faceless facilitators.</b></i> is the first episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_18\" title=\"Series 18\">Series 18</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">Taskmaster</a></i> and was broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Channel_4\" title=\"Channel 4\">Channel 4</a> on 12 September 2024. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Rosie_Jones\" title=\"Rosie Jones\">Rosie Jones</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode title</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Alternate_titles\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternate titles</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/The_faceless_facilitators.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Greg_Davies\" title=\"Greg Davies\">Greg Davies</a> claims that <a href=\"/wiki/Alex_Horne\" title=\"Alex Horne\">Alex Horne</a> calls the members of the show’s production crew \"the faceless facilitators of his genius\", during studio discussion of <a href=\"/wiki/Jack_Dee\" title=\"Jack Dee\">Jack Dee</a>’s attempt at the <a href=\"/wiki/Do_the_most_beautiful_thing_with_bubbles\" title=\"Do the most beautiful thing with bubbles\">Do the most beautiful thing with bubbles</a> task. The title card features bubbles and a can, referencing the <a href=\"/wiki/Do_the_most_beautiful_thing_with_bubbles\" title=\"Do the most beautiful thing with bubbles\">Do the most beautiful thing with bubbles</a> task, and the <a href=\"/wiki/Knock_over_exactly_100_cans\" title=\"Knock over exactly 100 cans\">Knock over exactly 100 cans</a> task.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternate_titles\">Alternate titles</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/The_faceless_facilitators.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>On Finland's MTV Katsomo streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Kasvottomat mahdollistajat', which translates as 'The faceless enablers'.</li>\n<li>On Norway's Discovery+ Norge streaming platform, this episode is titled 'De ansiktsløse tilretteleggerne ', which translates as 'The faceless facilitators'.<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/The_faceless_facilitators.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Andy_Zaltzman\" title=\"Andy Zaltzman\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Andy Zaltzman</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Bab%C3%A1t%C3%BAnd%C3%A9_Al%C3%A9sh%C3%A9\" title=\"Babátúndé Aléshé\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Babátúndé Aléshé</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Emma_Sidi\" title=\"Emma Sidi\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Emma Sidi</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Jack_Dee\" title=\"Jack Dee\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Jack Dee</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Rosie_Jones\" title=\"Rosie Jones\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Rosie Jones</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Best_thing_that_has_been_inside_you\" title=\"Best thing that has been inside you\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> Best thing that has been inside you.\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/Say_a_word_beginning_with_Q\" title=\"Say a word beginning with Q\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>Do not say any of this out loud. Carry out each instruction before reading the next. You must remain silent until you've completed all four instructions. Stare at camera number one for at least thirty seconds without smiling. Eat an imaginary fly that has just landed on you. Act like you don't like how it feels in your stomach at all. Look under the 6th, 33rd, 56th, and 91st letters of this task.\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">3\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">1\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">4\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">2\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td>Say a word beginning with Q.\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Knock_over_exactly_100_cans\" title=\"Knock over exactly 100 cans\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td>Knock over exactly 100 cans. You must throw all five balls and pull one rope nice and hard. You must stay on the spot at all times and you may not move the spot.\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Do_the_most_beautiful_thing_with_bubbles\" title=\"Do the most beautiful thing with bubbles\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td>Do the most beautiful thing with bubbles.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Drink_the_vinegar\" title=\"Drink the vinegar\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Live:</b> Drink the vinegar. On your turn, you can either drink from one straw or not drink at all and get a clue from Alex instead. You must stand on the spot when choosing your straw and you must never stray from the spot. Only the vinegar drinker wins.\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td>9\n</td>\n<td>9\n</td>\n<td>13\n</td>\n<td>16\n</td>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\">17\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: External links\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/The_faceless_facilitators.?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: External links\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.channel4.com/programmes/taskmaster/\"><i>The faceless facilitators.</i> on All 4</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260920141528\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.094 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.133 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 939/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 26192/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 174/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 8/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.016/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 800559/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   74.286      1 -total\n 49.86%   37.042      1 Template:Spoilers\n 48.27%   35.860      1 Template:MessageBox\n 25.20%   18.721      1 Template:Episode_infobox\n 19.33%   14.362      1 Template:Episodes\n 12.20%    9.061     10 Template:Link\n  2.76%    2.052      5 Template:Color\n  2.16%    1.602      1 Template:Chronology\n  1.76%    1.310      1 Template:Clear\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_task:pcache:idhash:4589-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260920141528 and revision id 44326. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}}}